  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Hi all，<br style=\"\" />【暗影玫瑰】活动将于4.10日进入测试阶段，现申请相关资源及礼物配置。<br style=\"\" />辛苦@叶导 审批，&nbsp;<br style=\"\" />辛苦@灿灿配置并返回相关id。</p><p>资源需求</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 41.7178%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 10.9236%;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 22.9518%;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 22.7064%;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 43.3936%;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>资源类型</td><td>资源名称</td><td>资源id</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>prize_type</td><td>prize_name</td><td>resource_id</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>PK背景</td><td>暗影玫瑰PK背景</td><td>170</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"8\">称号</td><td>影蚀华章称号</td><td>1747</td><td>4.20-4.23，暗影玫瑰活动获得～</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>野玫瑰称号</td><td>1746</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>血色玫瑰称号</td><td>1745</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>雾隐瑰刺称号</td><td>1744</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>破碎面具称号</td><td>1743</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>传奇红宝石称号</td><td>1742</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影玫瑰称号</td><td>1741</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影猎人称号</td><td>1740</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>弹幕边框</td><td>血色玫瑰弹幕边框</td><td>2836</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"4\">发言波纹</td><td>影蚀华章发言波纹</td><td>6859</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>野玫瑰发言波纹</td><td>7184</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影猎人发言波纹</td><td>7185</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>镜中对决发言波纹</td><td>3700</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"3\">公聊皮肤</td><td>野玫瑰公聊皮肤</td><td>7188</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>镜中对决公聊皮肤</td><td>6863</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影猎人公聊皮肤</td><td>7189</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"5\">麦序框</td><td>影蚀华章麦序框</td><td>6854</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>雾隐瑰刺麦序框</td><td>7179</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>野玫瑰麦序框</td><td>7178</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影玫瑰麦序框</td><td>7180</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影猎人麦序框</td><td>7181</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>派对背景</td><td>暗影玫瑰派对背景</td><td>381</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"2\">上麦动效</td><td>野玫瑰上麦动效</td><td>7182</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影猎人上麦动效</td><td>7183</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>送礼托盘</td><td>传奇红宝石送礼托盘</td><td>5902</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"7\">头像框</td><td>影蚀华章头像框</td><td>6853</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>雾隐瑰刺头像框</td><td>7175</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>野玫瑰头像框</td><td>7174</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>破碎面具头像框</td><td>2187</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>镜中对决头像框</td><td>714</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影玫瑰头像框</td><td>7176</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影猎人头像框</td><td>7177</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>推荐卡</td><td>热十三推荐卡</td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"8\">主页挂件</td><td>影蚀华章主页挂件</td><td>4439</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>雾隐瑰刺主页挂件</td><td>4440</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>野玫瑰主页挂件</td><td>6856</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>野玫瑰主页浮屏</td><td>6858</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影玫瑰主页挂件</td><td>5524</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影玫瑰主页浮屏</td><td>5523</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影猎人主页挂件</td><td>6855</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影猎人主页浮屏</td><td>6857</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"3\">资料卡浮屏</td><td>雾隐瑰刺资料卡浮屏</td><td>5257</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>野玫瑰资料卡浮屏</td><td>7187</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>血色玫瑰资料卡浮屏</td><td>3307</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"3\">座驾</td><td>破碎面具进房座驾</td><td>1406</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>传奇红宝石半屏座驾</td><td>3634</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>暗影猎人半屏座驾</td><td>7186</td><td><br /><